@startuml
title RPRRSBSI V4-2 Initial Tags, ContentSummary, and AISupervisor Slice
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

component "Get-ContentSummary\nagent + PowerShell" as Producer
component "AceOutpost scheduled\ningestion task" as Ingest
database "Outpost local\nprojection + outbox" as Local
component "Ace sync/API" as Api
database "Ace ContentSummary\nand AISupervisor tables" as Ace
component "Claude adapter" as Claude
component "Codex adapter" as Codex
component "AISupervisor proxy" as Proxy
component "AceCommander\nvisualizers" as UI

Producer --> Ingest : Tags + summaries
Ingest --> Local : raw + normalized,\nidempotent checkpoint
Local --> Api : durable envelope
Api --> Ace
Claude --> Proxy : request/response
Codex --> Proxy : request/response
Proxy --> Ace : safe metadata,\nheaders, token metrics
Ace --> UI : raw summaries
Ace --> UI : Tag Any/All query
Ace --> UI : UTC token series

note bottom of Proxy
  Body capture off initially.
  Secret headers never stored.
end note

note bottom of Ingest
  Inferred Rules remain Ace overlays/candidates.
  No automatic ATAP publication.
end note
@enduml
